{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（23日）上午11時28分，警方接報指油塘邨富塘樓地下的房署辦公室內，一名男工人遭塌下的假天花板擊中，頭部受傷。救援人員到場，將傷者送往聯合醫院治理。</p><p>現場為房屋署租務事務管理處，人員以膠帶圍封現場，可見旁邊放有數塊假天花板。據了解，現場有工程進行， 其間疑有假天花板丟下。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場是房屋署租務辦事處。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146066449086025728587930.jpeg/TC-1A2Sj9ktwOMD8tzymlBYrXolfyG4U1R5ruvAea7o\"/><figcaption>現場是房屋署租務辦事處。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員以膠帶圍封現場。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146066446498009088057396.jpeg/epXA5YbeTsnqfeNxf8YPa8Yuek3bSBvW2wjOdP4IznQ\"/><figcaption>人員以膠帶圍封現場。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146066443603808256349027.jpeg/Hx3MVdZxyTZdA6j2ChJJRmMC0DnDkP2dYFQfKEVUHyg\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"部份假天花被揭開，露出內裡的電線和喉管。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146068349063532544521389.jpeg/fVjNO--2DelPoiDmaji8rrjGaiNwNwUOzyB6pM8geqQ\"/><figcaption>部份假天花被揭開，露出內裡的電線和喉管。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"地面放有數塊假天花板。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146068351987093504931670.jpeg/ul7t35_HMqp-GvYD4h74YCYD8lHgR96E7xjG_e8Yxv0\"/><figcaption>地面放有數塊假天花板。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"部份假天花被揭開，露出內裡的電線和喉管。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146068354847739904673950.jpeg/QbLXsnBmTAVnUqvUmHU_75eYVFapnKiik8aZdJPGmXQ\"/><figcaption>部份假天花被揭開，露出內裡的電線和喉管。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-23T04:59:01.873895+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}